Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pandora never actually opened a\Nbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In the oldest Greek version of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the myth, she opened a sealed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,jar—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and suffering and hardship escaped\Ninto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She slammed it shut,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Only hope remained inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Centuries later,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,retellings turned the jar into a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,box,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but the warning survived:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,one tempting choice can unleash\Nconsequences
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you can’t easily contain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why “opening Pandora’s box”\Nstill
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.77,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,means starting something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,that suddenly becomes far bigger\Nthan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you expected.
